This Promotion is governed by the laws of USA. All disputes shall be resolved individually (not as part of a class action) and exclusively in the courts located in USA.

To obtain a list of winners, contact the Sponsor within four (4) weeks of the sweepstakes' end date.

This Promotion is not sponsored, endorsed, or administered by any social media platform, including but not limited to Facebook, Instagram, Twitter (X), YouTube, or Reddit. You are providing your information to the Sponsor.

